  "helpApplyTemplate": "Apply template",
  "helpVariablesTitle": "Variables",
  "helpVariablesBody": "Each variable (e.g. A, B or co2) stands for a field from the database. Readings are picked from the schema, optionally with their own measurement and tag filters. In the formula you only use the name of the variable.",
  "helpOperatorsTitle": "Operators",
  "helpOperatorsBody": "+ - * / and parentheses. Comparisons (< > <= >= == !=) return 1 (true) or 0 (false). Example: (A + B) / 2 or A > 25.",
  "helpStepsTitle": "Intermediate steps",
  "helpStepsBody": "Intermediate steps are named partial formulas. They are calculated from top to bottom and may use variables and earlier steps. The formula at the top is the result and may use all steps.",
  "helpHistoryTitle": "History and aggregate",
  "helpHistoryBody": "For the history chart and the aggregate the formula is calculated per time bucket (average per interval). If a value is missing in a bucket, the bucket is skipped or the last value is carried over (gap policy). Aggregate computes min/max/mean over the calculated values.",
  "helpErrorsTitle": "Errors",
  "helpErrorsBody": "Syntax errors show the position in the text. \"Division by zero\", \"Unknown function\", a wrong number of arguments, \"Missing variable\" and domain errors (e.g. sqrt of a negative number, ln(0)) are never silently shown as 0, but as a readable error message.",
  "helpFnMin": "Smallest value (any number of arguments, at least one).",
  "helpFnMax": "Largest value (any number of arguments, at least one).",
  "helpFnClampSignature": "clamp(x, low, high)",
  "helpFnClamp": "Limits x to the range low to high.",
  "helpFnAbs": "Absolute value (without sign).",
  "helpFnPowSignature": "pow(base, exponent)",
  "helpFnPow": "Power.",
  "helpFnSqrt": "Square root (x must not be negative).",
  "helpFnLn": "Natural logarithm (x must be greater than 0).",
  "helpFnLog10": "Base-10 logarithm (x must be greater than 0).",
  "helpFnExp": "e to the power of x.",
  "helpFnRound": "Rounds to the nearest whole number (.5 away from 0).",
  "helpFnFloor": "Rounds down.",
  "helpFnCeil": "Rounds up.",
  "helpFnIfSignature": "if(condition, then, else)",
  "helpFnIf": "Picks one of two values depending on the condition (not 0 = true). Only the chosen branch is calculated, e.g. if(B == 0, 0, A / B).",
  "helpConstPi": "Pi 3.14159…",
  "helpConstE": "Euler's number 2.71828…",
  "templateIaqDescription": "Air quality index 0 to 100. Each partial score is a linear ramp (CO₂ 600 ppm = 100, 2000 ppm = 0; VOC index 100 = 100, 250 = 0; PM2.5 5 µg/m³ = 100, 35 = 0; humidity 50 % = 100, 20 % or 80 % = 0). The worst partial score determines the result. Thresholds can be adjusted in the intermediate steps.",
